# The TCFD compliance checker needs no environment variables to run.
#
# Optional:
# Directory of the trained pillar/disclosure passage models, relative to backend/
# (default: models/tcfd_external). Set to "none" for keyword/TF-IDF scoring only,
# e.g. for fast tests or low-memory machines.
# TCFD_PASSAGE_MODELS=models/tcfd_external
